 "description": "LET'S MAKE SPACE: CLEANING YOUR PHONE'S STORAGE HAS NEVER BEEN SMARTER!\nSmart Cleaner isn't just an app; it's a solution that turns storage cleanup into a quick, fun, and secure task.\n\nFAST & DEEP CLEANING\nFast Clean — Instantly clear the clutter of duplicates and unneeded files.\nDeep Clean — Dive deeper to identify and remove space-wasting media you don't even use.\n\nSORT, COMPRESS & SAVE\nSmartly sort and compress your largest files without losing any data, instantly boosting your storage space.\n\nSTRONG INBOX CLEANING \nFilter Email by different labels to clean up spams in one tab, keeping inbox tidy and organized.\n\nCALENDER MANAGE & CLEANING\nSmart Cleaner quickly scan your calendar for past events,removing events to organize your schedule.\n\nCONTACT MERGING & CLEANING\nAutomatically identify and merge duplicate contacts, deleting empty contacts keeping your address book neat and tidy.\n\nNETWORK SPEED MEASUREMENT\nTest internet connection speed anytime.\n\nKEEP YOUR MEMORIES, NOT CLUTTER\nSmart Cleaner helps you keep the best moments by suggesting which photos and videos are worth keeping based on various criteria.\n\nSTRESS-FREE AND PRODUCTIVE\nBeat the boredom of manual cleanups and reclaim your time. Smart Cleaner is your smart choice for a cleaner, more organized device.\n\nEFFORTLESS SUBSCRIPTION MANAGEMENT\nChoose from our flexible subscription plans:\n\n• Weekly Subscription\n• Yearly Subscription\n\nEnjoy a FREE TRIAL FOR 3 DAYS with full access to all Smart Cleaner features. Cancel anytime before the trial ends to avoid charges.\nManage your subscription with ease from your iPhone settings.\nDownload Smart Cleaner now and say goodbye to storage woes. Experience a faster, more efficient device today!\n\nFor support and more info, visit:\nhttps://qrcode-scan.com/\nBy using Smart Cleaner you agree to our Term of Use(in app) and Privacy Policy:https://qrcode-scan.com/privacy\n\nIf you have any questions or suggestions, please let us know: naicoonancy@protonmail.com",
